t; now, as it use 1ED Contracts mechanics still. But till the premier of 2ED <b>Changeling</b> core, it will sufice. And my playeress is like squicking with joy to check the new Fae-Touched in our <b>Changeling</b> game, using this sheet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Coolness! Glad they're enjoying it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And true, it's kind of a hybrid sheet, for now anyway... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T14:43:38-07:00","id":563421,"title":"","content":"Just wanted to put my props in about the Fae-Touched and also how Oneiromancy seems to be overhauled and has some cool sounding bits added in now. The Fae-Touched make for great NPCs if they're not added in as player characters to a chronicle and are super great for adding plot seeds into a game... Plus I really love the whole thing a Changeling can do by going into dreams and doing dream magic, which is partly what attracts me to Beast:the Primordial also.<br /> <br /> I'm already considering a custom Court that's centred most on Oneiromancy and Dream-Weaving and all that dream-stuff. I really want to see Fae-Touched in a similar way that in W:tF each character can make a Wolf-Blooded and human additions to the Pack.<br /> Doing something like this for each Changeling, but not as a larger pack but calling it something like a 'Household' or 'Folk' (after fair folk) representing close ones for each character outside the Motley formed with the other PCs and that they're npcs personal to that specific PC only would be fairly awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T20:16:36-07:00","id":563675,"title":"","content":"It says Fae Touched can join courts, so by raw they can take Court Mantle Merits, joining a Court, but it says nothing about humans joining a court, although the Cult of Mitra is sort of borderlinish.<br /> <br /> But the equivilant of the Pack is the Motley, which even in Changeling 1e could be joined by just about anything that took the Motley's Pledge, including humans, Vampires, Werewolves, Immortals, Mages, Possessed ect... if they wanted, I don't see why it would be different this time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,"